            "description": "🚀 CURRENT WORKING ENDPOINTS (Production: https://equitaskly-api.vercel.app)\n\n🏠 **Health & Testing:**\n- GET /api/health (Server health status with features list)\n- GET /api/tasks/categories?mode=household|work (Get task categories)\n\n🔐 **Authentication (Enhanced):**\n- POST /api/auth/signup (Create account + auto group setup)\n- POST /api/auth/login (Authenticate + group context)\n- GET /api/auth/profile (Get user profile)\n- GET /api/auth/verify (Verify token validity)\n- POST /api/auth/logout (Logout user)\n\n🔗 **OAuth Authentication:**\n- POST /api/auth/oauth/{provider} (Google, GitHub, etc.)\n- POST /api/auth/oauth/callback (Handle OAuth callback)\n\n📋 **Task Management (Enhanced):**\n- POST /api/tasks (Create with auto-assignment)\n- GET /api/tasks (Get all user's group tasks)\n- GET /api/tasks/my-tasks (Get tasks assigned to user)\n- GET /api/tasks/group/{groupId} (Get group tasks)\n- PUT /api/tasks/{id} (Update task)\n- PATCH /api/tasks/{id}/complete (Mark complete)\n- PATCH /api/tasks/{id}/toggle (Toggle completion)\n- PATCH /api/tasks/{id}/assign (Assign to user)\n- DELETE /api/tasks/{id} (Delete task)\n- GET /api/tasks/stats?group_id={id} (Task statistics)\n\n🔧 **Enhanced Features:**\n✅ **Corrected Database Schema:** Uses assignee_id, created_by, group_id\n✅ **Auto-Assignment:** Tasks auto-assign to creator if no assignee specified\n✅ **Fallback Groups:** Creates personal group context for users without memberships\n✅ **Enhanced Security:** Improved token encryption and validation\n✅ **Mobile Compatibility:** Handles mixed field naming (assignedTo → assignee_id)\n✅ **Smart Assignment:** Resolves 'Me' assignments to current user ID\n\n🔒 **Security Enhancements:**\n- ✅ Enhanced token storage with device-level encryption\n- ✅ Biometric authentication requirements\n- ✅ Token expiry validation on client-side\n- ✅ Secure keychain/keystore isolation\n- ✅ Separate storage for sensitive data\n\n📱 **Mobile App Integration:**\n- ✅ Multiple URL fallback for connectivity\n- ✅ Automatic retry logic with exponential backoff\n- ✅ Enhanced logging for debugging\n- ✅ Graceful handling of missing group context\n- ✅ Intelligent assignee resolution\n\n⚠️ **Important Notes:**\n- Production API: https://equitaskly-api.vercel.app\n- Local Development: http://localhost:4000\n- All task endpoints require Bearer token authentication\n- Database uses snake_case field naming (assignee_id, not assignedTo)\n- Tasks always have an assignee (defaults to creator)\n- Groups are auto-created for users without memberships\n\n🧪 **Testing:**\n- Run 'Enhanced Signup' first to get auth token\n- Create tasks with various assignee configurations\n- Test both production and local environments\n- Verify proper field mapping in responses"
